  "description": "OMD Estate Agents are thrilled to present this beautifully presented 3 bed family home to the letting market. \n\nA well-presented three-bedroom house located in the popular Blarney Park road in Kimmage.\n\nThe property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation, with the added benefit of a large south-facing rear garden and off-street parking.\n\n3 bedrooms, 2 double, one single\n\nWell-presented throughout\n\nLarge south-facing rear garden\n\nOff-street parking\n\nBER Rating: D\n\nExcellent location in Kimmage with shops, coffe shops and bus routes. The park is a short stroll away and an easy commute to the city. \nThe property is partially furnished and has been professionally painted and cleaned. ",
